Significance: minor
Type: deprecated

Every hook moves from internal_comments/ to dws_ic/, and each v1 name still fires first, deprecated: create_comment_data (now internal_comment/creation_data), the ajax before_insert_comment, update_internal_comment_data, before_update_comment and before_trash_comment hooks (now internal_comment/before_insert, update_data, before_update and before_trash), wp_table_output/insert_after (now list_table/preceding_column), metabox_output/comment_classes (now meta_box/comment_classes), metabox_output/single_comment/actions/start and end (now meta_box/before_comment_actions and after_comment_actions), metabox_output/inline_actions, inline_actions/insert, inline_actions/edit and reply (now meta_box/before_form_buttons, before_new_comment_buttons, before_edit_comment_buttons and before_reply_buttons), the general and plugin groups' get_group_fields (now settings/general_fields and settings/plugin_fields) and the get_validated_option_value filters (now settings/validated_value).
